Both 'd' (dissolve) and 'Tr' (transparency) are set to be the same value and that seems to contrast with what found in the [Wikipedia .obj format](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wavefront_.obj_file) page where Tr = 1 - d  (not that the wikipedia is the necessarily correct on that)

